---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Offline" description="Kamu sedang offline.">
  <section class="container-mm py-24 text-center">
    <p class="zine-no text-[7rem] leading-none md:text-[10rem]">✳</p>
    <p class="eyebrow mt-2">SEDANG OFFLINE</p>
    <h1 class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl font-serif text-3xl tracking-tight md:text-4xl">
      Koneksi <em class="italic">terputus</em>.
    </h1>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-md text-muted-foreground">
      Halaman yang sudah pernah kamu buka tetap bisa dibaca offline. Cek koneksi, lalu muat ulang.
    </p>
    <a href="/" class="btn-primary mt-7">Coba lagi</a>
  </section>
</Base>
